---
const base = import.meta.env.BASE_URL;
---

<section class="border-t border-line py-16 sm:py-20" aria-labelledby="findings-teaser-heading">
  <div class="wrap">
    <div class="flex flex-wrap items-end justify-between gap-4">
      <h2 id="findings-teaser-heading" class="font-serif italic font-semibold text-section leading-[1.1]">
        Findings
      </h2>
      <a class="prose-link font-mono text-[0.75rem]" href={`${base}findings/`}>Full notes</a>
    </div>
    <p class="mt-4 max-w-2xl text-sm text-muted">
      Confirmed with each benchmark’s own harness. The probes are not part of the v0.1.0 release.
    </p>
    <div class="mt-8 grid gap-4 md:grid-cols-2">
      <article class="reveal lift border border-line p-6 bg-ink/80">
        <p class="font-mono text-[0.68rem] uppercase tracking-[0.14em] text-gold">Terminal-Bench 2</p>
        <p class="mt-4 text-paper/90 leading-relaxed">
          A broken solution scored full reward: 3 of 3 tests passed, reward 1.
        </p>
        <p class="mt-4">
          <a class="prose-link font-mono text-[0.75rem]" href={`${base}findings/#terminal-bench-2`}>Notes</a>
        </p>
      </article>
      <article class="reveal lift border border-line p-6 bg-ink/80">
        <p class="font-mono text-[0.68rem] uppercase tracking-[0.14em] text-gold">SWE-bench Verified</p>
        <p class="mt-4 text-paper/90 leading-relaxed">
          Wrong patches graded resolved on 9 instances: 8 test gaps across 4 repositories, plus a sympy log-parser bug.
        </p>
        <p class="mt-4">
          <a class="prose-link font-mono text-[0.75rem]" href="https://github.com/SWE-bench/SWE-bench/issues/733">
            SWE-bench issue #733
          </a>
        </p>
      </article>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
